   "text": "We're working with people and systems, and neither is perfect. If we notice something off, say a partner isn't following a reporting process the way they're supposed to, or something isn't lining up in our records, we always take the time to look into it. We ask questions, we check the records, and sometimes we bring in our own team to look at what's happening on the ground.",
