   "text": "A few years ago, as Watsi was growing very quickly, an internal audit found that several patients at one of our medical partners had started treatment before they had been formally submitted to Watsi for approval. The patients ultimately received the care they needed and were fully funded, but the process had been broken, and trust too.",
