   "text": "We wrote about what happened, explained why it happened. In this case, our partners were scaling very quickly and were dealing with administrative backlogs, and then shared what we were doing to prevent it from happening again. We audited the operational processes across our medical partners and put additional support in place to help them scale with us.",
